# #163 — test-mode override. vite/vitest resolve this automatically for
# `mode: 'test'` (the mode vitest always runs under), taking precedence over
# .env. Points PUBLIC_ENTU_API_BASE at a guaranteed-unresolvable RFC 2606 host
# so that even a bypass of the setupFiles fetch guard (networkGuard.setup.ts)
# cannot construct a URL that resolves to the real, live Entu install.
#
# Value matches the literal several specs assert against directly (they don't
# mock $lib/entu-config — e.g. request.spec.ts, entuSeasons.spec.ts,
# entityCreate.spec.ts, marker.spec.ts, seasonManage.spec.ts, exchange.spec.ts
# — see #163 C6 rewrite). Keep this in sync if that literal ever changes.
PUBLIC_ENTU_API_BASE=https://api.entu-test.invalid/
